21875], "pos": [831.630615234375, 1149.6871337890625], "widgets_values": ["A high-impact e-commerce product poster for Budweiser beer, designed with bold modern aesthetics and rich visual storytelling. The composition features two aluminum cans of Budweiser — one upright, glossy and dew-dappled; the other lying on its side, slightly tilted to suggest refreshment and casual indulgence — resting on a dark reflective surface that enhances depth through subtle liquid reflections.\n\nDominant color palette: Deep crimson red gradients transition into warm golden-orange tones in the background, evoking passion, luxury, and warmth — classic Budweiser branding amplified by contemporary digital design. Accents are rendered in metallic silver, crisp white text, and glowing orange highlights (e.g., “<89>” price tag) to create contrast while maintaining brand cohesion.\n\nMain Title Design:\nTop-center, large stylized typography reads \"Budweiser 百威啤酒\" using an elegant serif font with flowing calligraphic curves reminiscent of premium beverage packaging — subtly echoing tradition yet feeling fresh and modern. Below it, smaller italicized Chinese phrases \"<敬真我>\" and \"<敬不凡>\" appear diagonally separated by thin lines, suggesting aspiration and celebration. These subtitles use clean sans-serif fonts with slight embossing effects to enhance tactile realism against the gradient backdrop.\n\nPromotional Text Placement & Styling:\n\n• Offer Highlight (“买两箱 赠送冰啤酒 9听”) positioned near center-right above the rolled can, presented as bullet-pointed promotional copy in light beige sans-serif, small but legible.\n  \n• Price Tag (\"<89>\") is encased within a circular emblem resembling a vintage badge or seal, placed at upper right quadrant — outlined in gold foil effect with inner glow, making it pop visually from the warmer background without overpowering elements.\n\n• Date Range (\"12.12 - 12.22\") appears vertically aligned next to the standing can’s left edge, styled like handwritten script with soft shadow drop to imply urgency and limited-time appeal.\n\n• Three oval-shaped benefit badges sit horizontally beneath the cans: \n   • Left: “精选原料” – minimalist rounded rectangle filled with deep burgundy and edged in chrome;\n   • Center: “甄选麦芽” – same style, centered between cans;\n   • Right: “口感顺滑” – matching shape, completing trio symmetry.\n\nAdditional Brand Reinforcement:\nBottom banner spans full width featuring oversized cursive-style “Budweiser,” hand-lettered in shimmering rose-gold outline over black base—evokes elegance and nostalgia while remaining unmistakably modern. A single sparkling starburst graphic emerges off-center below this line to add dynamism and celebratory energy.\n\nLayout Composition Principles:\nThe central axis follows the rule-of-thirds principle — placing key products along vertical midline, offering balanced weight distribution despite asymmetrical placement of fallen can. Background uses radial blur/gradient fade technique to draw focus toward foreground objects without distracting viewer. Negative space around text blocks ensures readability even when viewed quickly on mobile screens.\n\nTypography Flexibility Applied:\nAll headings utilize custom-designed typefaces blended across styles — traditional serif used for main title, geometric sans-serifs for functional info (dates/prices), brush-stroke-inspired cursives for emotional cues (<敬真我>). This hybrid approach maintains clarity while enhancing perceived quality and authenticity.\n\nColor Harmony Strategy:\nPrimary Red (#C03456–#D72E3F): Represents power, excitement, trustworthiness.\nSecondary Gold Orange (#FFBB33–#FAAC33): Adds vibrancy and heat sensation associated with freshness and flavor.\nAccent Silver/#FFFDD0: Used sparingly for borders, outlines, highlights — ensuring no clash amid saturated colors.\nDark Black Base Layer (#000000): Provides grounding foundation and contrast needed for all textual elements.\n\nFinal Output Prompt Translation:\n“Create a dynamic e-commerce advertisement poster for Budweiser Beer showcasing two chilled aluminum cans under dramatic lighting, set against radiant gradient backgrounds transitioning from deep crimson to amber. Employ luxurious typography combining serif classics with sleek sans-serif utility texts. Place strategic promotional offers such as ‘Buy Two Boxes Get Nine Ice Beers Free’ alongside eye-catching pricing tags enclosed in ornate seals. Include three horizontal benefit icons emphasizing ingredient selection, malt refinement, and smooth taste profile. Anchor layout via strong compositional balance rooted in photographic realism enhanced digitally. Utilize dominant reds, metallic silvers, and ambient gold accents for maximal impact. Style must feel both timeless and cutting-edge.” \n\nThis prompt encapsulates every detail requested — including specific placements, stylistic treatments per element, tone-setting visuals, and technical execution parameters — ready for AI image generation tools capable of interpreting complex multi-layered designs based on precise instruction sets."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 118, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 73, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [115], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [292.51519775390625, 88], "pos": [841.177734375, 1055.7916259765625], "widgets_values": ["高饱和，艳丽的颜色，多余的文字，多余的logo"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 113, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name